  unitName: Scythe Alice
  unitId: 60113
  unitNumber: 169
  description: The scythe-wielding, eighth princess of the ruined Bariura Empire.
    She was gradually consumed by madness as she fought with her weapon. She continued
    killing, but eventually guilt began to pool up inside her. The emperor noticed
    this and led her deeper into the darkness in hopes of making her into a weapon
    for the empire.
  summonDesc: What more do you wish of me?<br>I can't take it anymore.<br>But what
    else can I do...
  fusionDesc: Ugh... I-I'm fine.<br>All that energy just<br>got to me a bit...
  evoDesc: How am I like this?<br>OK then, you don't have to <br>say anything...
  element: 6
  rarity: 3
